            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Mong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Frank M\n2 contributions\n0\nBest lunch ever\nAug 2026 • Friends\nWe came here today with our friend Tu Michael, we are from Canada. The food was incredible. We had the fish porridge, chicken in pumpkin, and barbecued sturgeon. Everything was fresh, very clean, and tasty. We will definitely come back again! Excellent regional SA Pa food. We also stayed at Link Farmstay and recommend as well.\nWritten August 2, 2026",
