            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Mong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jo L\n5 contributions\n0\nAm Thuc Mong Restaurant - Amazing!!\nJun 2026 • Couples\nEverything about this restaurant was fantastic- the food was delicious and the variety was amazing. All the staff were really helpful giving us advice on which foods to order. They gave us smaller portions so we could try the different dishes. Highly recommend.\nWritten June 8, 2026\nThanh - ATM\nThank you so much for your wonderful review! We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the variety of dishes and found the food delicious. It's especially rewarding to know that our team could help you choose dishes and adjust the portions so you could experience more of our local specialties. Your recommendation means a lot to us, and we look forward to welcoming you back to Am Thuc Mong Restaurant Sapa on your next visit!\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
